      en: ["The fort was constructed by the Dutch between 1680 and 1684.", "It is located in the village of Black Rock on the island of Tobago.", "The primary purpose was to defend Courland Bay from invaders.", "The ruins were partially restored in the 1970s for public access.", "Several historic iron cannons are still preserved at the site today.", "It is situated near the monument commemorating Courlander settlers."],
      es: ["Conocido bajo el nombre de Fort Bennett.", "Situado en la isla caribeña de Trinidad.", "Parte del patrimonio cultural y geográfico de Trinidad."],
